{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X 在 S01、S02 等段的非定时感受词仍然偏密，纵向交替也不如 Y 的左右分栏容易快速定位；不过标记为“到时出现”的词不会同时堆满屏幕。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 的左右分栏更容易先抓住人物叙事、再扫旁边的感受词，因此快速浏览略占优势。但 X 用【】突出每段关键心理动作，又通过音乐节点逐步呈现感受，既让人知道他为什么舍不得、为什么犹豫，也能看到他如何逐渐改变。尤其 X 对亲近、委屈、孤独、怀念之间的矛盾刻画更具体，音乐主题和情绪变化也有更丰富的呼应，整体更有连续性和细腻度。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3b026a2d-e180-4271-a523-7011dfe3e578", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T231950401310Z", "elapsed_seconds": 109.0, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:21:39.400906+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "55e2ba68c1fe5b1d70254b9af449aa5184bb4c362b36df6a8ccf942c331e036b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_a